<title>USA: Dow, Nasdaq fall at opening.</title>
<headline>Dow, Nasdaq fall at opening.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow industrials and the Nasdaq compasite open down Tuesday after the release of April retail sales figures in line with expectations.</p>
<p>The Dow Industrials Index was off 2.47 at 7,290.28. The Nasdaq Composite down 1.00 at 1343.19. The 30-year long bond up 1/32 to yield 6.88 percent.</p>
